 support groups**: Both for patients and for care partners (separate groups are important)\n4. **Transportation alternatives**: Paratransit services, ride-sharing programs, volunteer driver programs, Area Agency on Aging transportation resources\n5. **Exercise community**: PD-specific programs — Rock Steady Boxing, Dance for PD, PD-specific yoga and cycling classes\n6. **Caregiver resources**: Respite care referral, caregiver support groups, Area Agency on Aging services\n7. **Legal and financial planning**: Encourage advance directive completion and financial/healthcare power of attorney while the patient has capacity',
